{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Hacker was known as the best of the best. Nobody knows why they quit. Some say their will was broken by the dark secrets at the heart of the Mainframe. Some say they simply retired to a penthouse suite in Low Earth Orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you leave the world of high-stakes cybercrime, it's hard to stay gone. With a call from an old enemy in need of help..<br>868-<strong>HACK</strong> is 868-<strong>BACK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From top indie artist Michael Brough comes his biggest game yet, a sequel to 2013's acclaimed 868-HACK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >868-BACK is inspired by roguelike dungeon crawlers \u2014 but the dungeons are computer servers, and your weapons are illicit software tools. It's a game of taking risks. Every nasty situation you find yourself in is your own fault.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal glittering data.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expose the megacorps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with cyborg gulls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat a bootleg burrito.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost the bass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Mainframe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT and expected to release late this year.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304110?t=1762797332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304110?t=1762797332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304110/c6cd2fd4fd5a54be0dbb525c1a102059c7ea8fe8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762797332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304110/c6cd2fd4fd5a54be0dbb525c1a102059c7ea8fe8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762797332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Hacker was known as the best of the best. Nobody knows why they quit. Some say their will was broken by the dark secrets at the heart of the Mainframe. Some say they simply retired to a penthouse suite in Low Earth Orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when you leave the world of high-stakes cybercrime, it's hard to stay gone. With a call from an old enemy in need of help..<br>868-<strong>HACK</strong> is 868-<strong>BACK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From top indie artist Michael Brough comes his biggest game yet, a sequel to 2013's acclaimed 868-HACK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >868-BACK is inspired by roguelike dungeon crawlers \u2014 but the dungeons are computer servers, and your weapons are illicit software tools. It's a game of taking risks. Every nasty situation you find yourself in is your own fault.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal glittering data.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expose the megacorps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with cyborg gulls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat a bootleg burrito.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost the bass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Mainframe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT and expected to release late this year.</p>","developers":["Michael Brough"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.